-- ============================================
-- Notes
-- ============================================
-- After running this migration:
-- 1. Refresh the Supabase Dashboard (Storage > Buckets)
-- 2. The "documentos" bucket should now show "Any" in the "ALLOWED MIME TYPES" column
-- 3. Test by uploading an Excel file (.xlsx or .xls) to verify it works
-- 4. If you still see restrictions, try the alternative approaches above
